this way, they make changes such as the&nbsp;<a href=\"/uae-labour-law\">UAE labor law</a>.</p>\n<p>In this case, criminal law is not far behind and has evolved to adapt to changes. For this reason, technology plays an important role since, currently, many processes are automated or perfected thanks to it and this case is no exception. Furthermore,&nbsp;<a href=\"/cybersecurity-in-dubai\">cybersecurity in Dubai</a>&nbsp;is a reality that many companies must consider to protect important information.</p>\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n<p>The main objective of the new UAE penal code is to protect women, domestic staff, and public security in the country. Furthermore, it is important to know everything about it in order to avoid committing any crime. Dubai is practically the safest city in the world today and it is thanks to measures like these.</p>\n<p>Therefore, if you want to know more about the penal code you can consult experts on the subject. In addition, they can help you answer questions such as, what is the most common <a href=\"/crime-rate-in-dubai\">crime in Dubai</a>? In this way, if you want to know more about security measures or topics related to security, do not hesitate to&nbsp;<a href=\"/blog\">visit our blog</a>, here you can find a lot of information about security in Dubai.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[&hellip;]</p>","protected":false},"author":27,"featured_media":10001400,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[152],"tags":[169,172,171,170],"class_list":["post","post-1400","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry"]}